{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WE HAVE ALIENS, YOU DON'T!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into a retro-styled space shooter built as a modern throwback to the 1980s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth is under attack, and it\u2019s up to you to hold the line against waves of Martian invaders and flying saucers. Start each run with a defensive shield\u2014then keep firing as the action escalates through 30 stages, complete with robotic voice effects that sell the arcade vibe. The shield won\u2019t last forever, so position smart, blast fast, and stay alive as the sky fills up. Save the army men for bonus points, rack up your score, and see if you\u2019ve got what it takes to top the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A modern version of an \u201980s space shooter</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30 stages with robotic voice effects</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Waves of Martian invaders and flying saucers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destructible defensive shield for clutch protection</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonus points for every army man you save</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade high score chasing</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic, pick-up-and-play arcade pacing</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamepad support</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go back to the 1980s and blast these Martians back into outer space!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2182960?t=1770996791","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2182960/7f6a86c409cc1fd8125f43e148a8ab7551916561/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=17709